{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $-7+3(-4e-3)$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $-7+3(-4e-3)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(3e+4)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -7+3(-4e-3)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(3e+4)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -7+(3)(-4e)-(3)3   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(3e+4)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -7+(-12e)-9   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(3e+4)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -12e-16   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-4)3e+(-4)4}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -12e-16   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12e+(-16)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -12e-16   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12e-16}   \u0026= -12e-16 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $-7+3(-4e-3)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{12e}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -7+3(-4e-3)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{12e}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -7+(3)(-4e)-(3)3    \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{12e}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}-7+(-12e)-9\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{12e}   \u0026\\ne -12e-16\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expression is equivalent to $-7+3(-4e-3)$ :\n\n\n-  ${-4(3e+4)} $\n","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $-7+3(-4e-3)$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-4(3e+4)$","correct":true},{"content":"$12e$","correct":false},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
